  "project_description": "Overview \n\nThe Media Title Length provides a feature that allows the webmaster to control and set the media title (name) field length.\n\n Installation \n\nThe installation of this module is like other Drupal modules, Install the module, and enable it.\n\n Configuration \n\nAfter the installation:\n\n \n Navigate to administer >> configuration >> media >> media title length settings \n Set media title length. \n \n Requirements \n\nThis module requires no modules outside of Drupal core.",
